  "solution": "**Calculation:**\n\nx[-3{-6(-a)}] + 6[-3{-3(-a)}] = 6a\n\nx[-3{6a}] + 6[-3{3a}] = 6a\n\nx[-18a] + 6[-9a] = 6a\n\nx[-18] + 6[-9] = 6\n\nx[-18] = 6 + 54\n\nx = - 60/18 = - 10/3\n\n**Therefore, Value of x is -(10)/(3)**",
